ares 6b8a58cf4eb86be37a97551d87d4fc9284a92d17 (2026-11-24), github.com/ares-emulator/ares. Zen1 changes: headless build option; firmware dumps replaced by one-byte placeholders (mia/Firmware/README.zen1); ares/System removed; mia firmwareLocation hook; N64 high-level boot without a PIF ROM (n64/pif/hle.cpp bootHLE); N64 hidden-RDRAM fallback without Vulkan; IDE-only cmake and .github subdirectories dropped.
